    <body>
      <section eId="sec_1">
        <heading>Article 1 — Subject-matter and objectives</heading>
        <content>
          <p>This Regulation lays down rules relating to the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec_2">
        <heading>Article 2 — Material scope</heading>
        <content>
          <p>This Regulation applies to the processing of personal data wholly or partly by automated means.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
